  "issues": [
    "UNACKNOWLEDGED DATA PROBLEMS: The check for QA outliers only looked for the exact string '999999.99' before cleaning. If those rows contain commas (e.g., '999,999.99'), they would not be counted, yet after cleaning they become 999999.99 and would inflate the mean. The analyst therefore may have missed the six internal QA orders, biasing the reported mean."
